---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="PDF Compress Karein Online Free - Zcompressor | 100% Private & Safe"
  description="Free me PDF file size kam karein. Zcompressor 100% private aur client-side tool hai jo aapke browser me hi bina server upload ke PDF compress karta hai. Fast, safe aur unlimited."
  keywords="pdf compress kaise kare, online pdf compressor free, pdf file size kam kare, pdf compress to 100kb, pdf compress to 200kb, upsc pdf compressor, nsp scholarship pdf compress"
  ogUrl="https://zcompressor.com/hi/"
  ogType="website"
>
  <!-- JSON-LD FAQ Schema in Hinglish for SEO -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "PDF file ka size kaise kam karein (compress kaise kare)?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Zcompressor par apni PDF file ko drag aur drop karein ya Select File button par click karein. Iske baad apna target size (jaise 100 KB, 200 KB, 300 KB) chunein aur 'Compress' par click karein. Kuch hi seconds me aapki optimized PDF download ke liye ready ho jayegi.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor par documents upload karna safe hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Haan, bilkul 100% safe hai. Zcompressor kisi bhi document ko server par upload nahi karta. Sabhi processing aapke browser aur device ke memory me hi hoti hai, jisse aapke Aadhaar card, marksheet aur private documents 100% confidential rehte hain.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya Zcompressor free hai aur koi daily limit hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Zcompressor bilkul free hai. Isme koi daily limits, file size restrictions ya page caps nahi hain. Aap jitni chahein utni files bina subscription aur bina sign-up ke compress kar sakte hain.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Kya compressed PDF par koi watermark lagta hai?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>Nahi. Zcompressor aapki files par koi bhi watermark, logo ya branding add nahi karta. Aapka document original jaisa hi clean rehta hai.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "UPSC ya NSP Scholarship portal ke liye PDF kaise compress karein?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "<p>UPSC OTR portal ke liye 20–300 KB aur NSP Scholarship portal ke liye 200 KB se kam ka PDF chahiye hota hai. Zcompressor me direct 200 KB aur 300 KB presets available hain jisse aapka document portal specifications ke according instantly resize ho jata hai.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  </script>

  <Header />

  <!-- Hero Section with Mesh Gradient -->
